variable half_box_len equal 16.4971771859341/2.0

variable confine_strength equal 0.02469        # set strength of qudratic confinement potential for SPH elements belonging to the same electron

### simulation parameters:

variable time_step_length equal 0.25e-3
variable equi_time_steps equal 1e4
variable buff_time_steps equal 1e3
variable CoM_check_time_steps equal 2e2
